# Copy to .env.cloudflare.mac. This file is for docker compose, not shell sourcing.
# The Mac helper supplies the image, local port, and persistent test data path.
CATALYST_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME=dev.kingracing.net

# Token from the separate catalyst-coach-dev tunnel, routed to http://catalyst:3210.
# Do not copy the catalyst-coach production tunnel token here: the hostname above
# is only a display label; the token determines which tunnel receives traffic.
# Protect dev.kingracing.net with Cloudflare Access before starting the test.
# Keep the real .env.cloudflare.mac private; it is gitignored.
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=
